    "body": "# **ILA**\n\n**CP Cost:** 118 CP\n\n**Description:** The Ila are god-like precursor architects of transcendent intelligence and luminous presence, founders of ancient megastructures and stargates.\n\n**Classification:** Entity (24 CP)\n\n**Size:** Large\n\n**Movement:** Flicker Movement / Flight 60 ft\n\n**Tech Level:** 5 (Precursor Singularity Manipulation)\n\n**Meta Level:** 6 (Deific / Reality Reshaping)\n\n**Homeworld:** The Ring Architect Capitals\n\n**Stigma:** Deific (-6), Xeno (-2)\n\n**Ability Modifiers:**\n* +4 Int [16 CP]\n\n**Skills:**\n* +40 Skills [32 CP]\n\n**Species Features:**\n* Progenitor Heritage [26 CP]\n* Corporeal as desired (Semi-Corporeal) [4 CP]\n* Large Size [2 CP]\n* Flicker Movement [4 CP]"
